{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Spirit Engine DX Demo\u00a0</strong>includes all features from the full game! The demo ends upon completing the first chapter out of 5. Written completely from the ground up in a new game engine, returning players can expect a great deal of polish from its original 2003 release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689900/extras/45b9867c08d70296c035239011e0ef65.poster.avif?t=1754614175\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689900/extras/45b9867c08d70296c035239011e0ef65.webm?t=1754614175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689900/extras/45b9867c08d70296c035239011e0ef65.mp4?t=1754614175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for modern displays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved UI and control options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Updated dialogue and various graphical improvements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty and speed options (yes, there is an 'Absurd' mode!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebalanced gameplay</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3689900?t=1754614175","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3689900?t=1754614175","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689900/31254fbbd4fa08f451c4bd8127e04f134535221f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754614175","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689900/31254fbbd4fa08f451c4bd8127e04f134535221f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754614175","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","